 players** in a public server or create a private one with friends!\n\nPlay through either the **Story Mode, Gamemodes** or perhaps just hangout & chat with friends in the lobby.\n\n{2244974466007548}\n\n# Customization:\n\nYou can customize your character with a wide variety of cosmetics!\n\nand may purchase them with **Nebulite** in the store!\nthere are many customization options in this game so you'll be able to create a great outfit and show it off to others!\n\nYou may also select the option of either being a **\"NovaCat or NovaBunny\"**\n\n{819769537341079}\n\n# Download Today!\nAre you ready to embark on your adventure?\n\n{4291138197875017}", "short_description": "Novalight Is A Fun Multiplayer Game That Also Has A Story To It!\nPlay Through The \"Story Mode\" or \"Gamemodes\"\nAnd Choose Your Own Path.."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/xdee1/privacy-policy?authuser=0", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "XDEE1", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/xdee1/novalight?authuser=0", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "528142316460358"}, {"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER"], "id": "9883238321789102"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "845224308165012"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "8452243